"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-11-30T06:58:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-05T16:18:29Z","closed_at":"2026-01-05T16:18:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nProduce-able in 4.5.1\nDid not encounter in 4.5 and 4.4 .\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.7080) - Intel(R) Core(TM) 5 120U (12 threads) - 15.70 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nDisplay server crashes after a while when doing window switching (ALT + TAB) multiple times in a row.\n\nIt's my habit to perform tutorials as I'm watching them and learning from them, thus I switch between Edge and Godot frequently using (ALT + TAB) key combination.\n\nAfter a while of doing this (Like 30 minutes or less), Suddenly nothing works in Godot, no button works and menu bars are empty, while some elements like File System and Scene window do work, the Output writes a lot of Errors with the following message:\n\n`ERROR: platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp:4011 - Parameter \"hicon\" is null.`\n\nI have tried using Godot for more than 2 hours straight on heavy demo projects, this behavior did not happen.\n\nNo matter the project size or complexity, this happens after a lot of window switching, I have encountered it multiple times and I can now reliably re-produce it.\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1134\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e966385-59db-424f-ab37-62ebac9de10b\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSwitch between a Browser and Godot for a about 30 minutes. I usually do it 2 to 10 times per minute.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIt's not tied to project any way, this happens on heavy demo projects and very simple projects the same way.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113350/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113350/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}